      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c52d671616c0849be803b2d"
      },
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Until we figure out who you really are, you are restricted to your cabin.\n\nI somehow doubt you're just a trade representative working for a [[DM.Factions[faction_MagistracyOfCanopus],Canopian]] wine maker, as you claim.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 3,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c80ea384f858d6a6b25d688"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f26230355c18000069",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c9cc297111b2f1dc907975c"
      },
      "index": 3,
      "text": "[[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreBarista],Barista]], you are not the DropShip I was expecting to extract me from this world and I don't trust you yet too.\n\nBut if you want to negotiate with these terms, fine.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "Who are you?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 4,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9ce637561d7161c229481430"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c83990cfc2c2a0729b67fcf"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "I am Jarring, just Jarring thank you, again I came from [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreVanra],Vanra]] in the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreDuchyOfOrloff],Duchy of Orloff]], and [[DM.Factions[faction_MaglissSpirits],Magliss Spirits]] hired me to scout for potential investment locations on several worlds.\n\nAre you mercs any good or did you just got joined all together for what you assumed was an easy money fighting the [[DM.Factions[faction_LoneWolves],Lone Wolves]]?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 5,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c3f9fd750c30bb4de1cd2a2"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cca93b483dcc8eef05c4849"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "What? Of course we are good, {COMPANY.CompanyName} has been operating as legitimate registered mercenaries for years with an official [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreMercenaryReviewBoard],MRB]] rating.\n\nAnd how do you know about the Lone Wolves?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 6,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c3f08b276ee75e37c634f84"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f26230355c18000069",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c2e4d78331342775201430f"
      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Barista, any MRB rating is fine as long as you take me off this planet before the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreConcordatConstabulary],Concordat Constabulary]] finds me.\n\nAnd about the Lone Wolves... let's put it this way, if I tell you about the location of the Inheritor base, do we have a deal to take me to the next system?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "Perhaps... since you mentioned now, why are the Taurians after you?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 7,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c552859b7bfd1c6b55fc125"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c53b3bef08e456391a8f018"
      },
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Because I stepped into witnessing how [[DM.Factions[faction_TaurusMajorisMining],TMM]] has been pressing the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreFarLookers],Far-Lookers]] for control of Mirfak by hiring mercenaries to raid their settlements.\n\nAnd when you first appeared, your company looked just like one of them to me.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 8,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c1abf4e7db861579fafd377"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c5f4436518388b0d1cbf152"
      },
      "index": 8,
      "text": "What, that's not what we have been told by Lady Marisol-Chaplin, she claimed that the Far Lookers escalated first by hiring the Lone Wolves.\n\nAnd that within them there are also Inheritors and that they need to cut down on the armed several groups to restore order.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 9,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c8d114588ff19cd9d201f6d"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f26230355c18000069",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c64c4a2003049d5427b15eb"
      },
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Marisol-Chaplin hasn't told you most of what happened - the Lone Wolves appeared and offered their services when the TMM mercenaries were suppressing the Far Lookers.\n\nThey accepted and then defeated the mercenaries, which gave her and the Taurian government a huge problem.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "I bet.",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 10,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9ce3680e2d9b1b80d0cd9caa"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c54c0bddfa3b62de660dd17"
      },
      "index": 10,
      "text": "And Taurians are doing this all over the Hyades Rim... systematically clean up competing claims on newly colonized worlds through mercenary contracts through proxy companies like Tauris Majoris Mining.\n\nBut ethnic cleansing looks bad on the news when TMM is doing it against their own people.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 11,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cfbe41a1b0f0b5768cf808c"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c3eb189f10fd7ebaab5d37d"
      },
      "index": 11,
      "text": "You are saying we have been ordered to clear a Far Looker colony by the Concordat representative, after she failed to do so through TMM?\n\nWhy on Terra would they want it removed?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 12,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c0908c369a815ff0beccfa7"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f26230355c18000069",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c475d0bc671db7aca1ce6b8"
      },
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Because my sources in the Concordat government tell me that there's institutional conflict between several ministries and the Far Lookers, in addition to the troubles already being caused by the rise of the Inheritors within their movement.\n\nColonization is a rich business and full of graft and corruption, isn't it?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 13,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c272f4b7821cbf100783bdc"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c161aaa9173d937898f3071"
      },
      "index": 13,
      "text": "We don't care about how the Taurians deal their dirty laundry by hiding it but in this case we are about to become their next unfinished business if we don't fulfill their contract.\n\nSo what can you give us in return for a ticket home, as you mentioned before?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 14,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c4c28f6d73f717de42d87b4"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c58229ca5f0faa0598b5644"
      },
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Marisol-Chaplin gave you the wrong location for the Inheritor leadership because she knew that the Lone Wolves were operating in the area.\n\nThat way she could get rid of their threat, then later redirect you to hit the Far Looker settlements until you 'found' the radicals.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 15,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c2e1b9c3f45efe07f25d371"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ce39e6fe3d8ba30c37e50b1"
      },
      "index": 15,
      "text": "And as I said before, I can give you the exact coordinates of the Inheritor leadership and prevent you from committing a number of war crimes against civilians.\n\nAfter you complete your contract, we can both go our own ways.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "We need a minute to discuss this.",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 16,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cbe05ff4dd2ed379b0159b9"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
